DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260824T150000
UID:6a4ea06c717ad78703157b3e@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Find your “inner magic” with Magic Mel during this upbeat\
 , hilarious\, and interactive magical experience. Expect a healthy dose of
