DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260724T120000
UID:6a444d487e16a03d00e93bd9@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Get ready for an underwater adventure by creating your very ow
 n shark headband! In this fun and interactive craft\, children will color 
 and assemble a wearable shark headband.\nThis hands-on program encourages 
 creativity\, builds fine motor skills\, and gives children the opportunity
  to practice cutting and coloring\, and following simple instructions. Jus
 t in time for Shark Week! Drop in\, all materials are provided.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a444d487e16a03d00e93bd9
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
