DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260710T120000
UID:6a444c6f0e851028002e4c92@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join us for a fun\, ocean-inspired craft as we turn paper into
  octopuses! Using colorful paper\, googly eyes\, and a little creativity\,
  children will design their own unique sea creature with lots of personali
 ty.\nThis hands-on program encourages creativity\, imagination\, and fine 
 motor skill development while giving young artists the chance to explore c
 olors\, shapes\, and simple crafting techniques. Drop in\, all materials a
 re provided.
LOCATION:St. Clair/Silverthorn
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a444c6f0e851028002e4c92
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
