DESCRIPTION:Every other Saturday Cliffcrest will be screening a free famil
 y friendly movie!\nThis months' movie:\nHero Mode\nWith her indie video ga
 me business on the brink of bankruptcy. Kate throws a Hail Mary and puts T
 roy\, her teenage coding genius son\, in charge of creating a video game t
 o save the company. It's a dream come true for Troy. But quite the opposit
 e for the company's disgruntled coders and their rival CEO..
