DESCRIPTION:Celebrate soccer's biggest event at Gerrard/Ashdale Library! D
 rop in for the following live screenings of scheduled matches in our secon
 d floor program room.\nMon June 15\, 12-2pm: Spain vs. Cape Verde\nMon Ju
 ne 15\, 3-5pm: Belgium vs. Egypt\nTues June 16\, 3-5pm: France vs. Senega
 l\nWed June 17\, 4-5:30pm: England vs. Croatia\nThurs June 18\, 3-5pm: S
 witzerland vs. Bosnia\nThurs June 18\, 6-8pm: Canada vs. Qatar\nTues June
  23\, 1-3pm: Portugal vs. Uzbekistan\nTues June 23\, 4-6pm: England vs. 
 Ghana\nWed June 24\, 3-5pm: Switzerland vs. Canada\nFri June 26\, 3-5pm:
  France vs. Norway\nMon June 29\, 4:30:6:30pm: Group E Winner vs Group A/
 B/C/D/F 3rd Place\nTues June 30\, 5-7pm: Group I Winner vs. Group C/D/F/G/
 H 3rd Place\nThurs July 2\, 3-5pm: Group H Winner vs. Group J 2nd Place\n
 Fri July 3\, 2-4pm: Group D 2nd Place vs. Group G 2nd Place\nMon July 6\,
  3-5pm: Match 83 Winner vs Match 84 Winner\nTues July 7\, 4-6pm: Match 85
  Winner vs Match 87 Winner\nFri July 10\, 3-5pm: -Match 93 Winner vs. Mat
 ch 94 Winner\nWed July 15\, 3-5pm: Match 99 Winner vs. Match 100 Winner
LOCATION:Gerrard/Ashdale\, 2nd Floor Program Room
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a2759ce43b41b3d006ce5ba
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
