DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260818T144500
UID:6a3577378ea300e2631ee7ce@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Join Dr. Bonkers as the colourful entertainer brings joy to ki
 ds and families! With music and instruments\, Dr. Bonkers and his best pup
 pet friend\, Larry\, teach lessons about friendship\, kindness\, and imagi
 nation. Through vibrant sing-alongs and fun antics\, Dr. Bonkers offers an
  unforgettable experience filled with laughter\, music\, and dancing!\nDay
 cares and Groups please phone 416-393-7746 to register. Please indicate gr
 oup size.
LOCATION:Lillian H. Smith\, Room BC Auditorium
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a3577378ea300e2631ee7ce
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
