DESCRIPTION:Join us for a special Halloween themed story time. We will rea
 d stories\, sing songs and get in the spooky spirit. Come dressed in costu
 me for our spooky summer celebration. Stick around after the story time to
  make a mask.\nVisit the front desk for a one stop “trick-or-treat” an
 d take home a pencil.\nProgram is geared towards ages 0-6\, but all ages a
 re welcome. Drop-in. Space is limited.
LOCATION:Maria A. Shchuka\, Children's program room
