BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Wonder Workshop: Pollution Challenge
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T140000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260711T160000
UID:6a0e3bff43b41b3d0067f905@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Do you ever think about the impact of one little person or one
  tiny thing on the planet? When one pollutant becomes many\, the planet hu
 rts. But when one person becomes many\, positive change can happen. In thi
 s workshop\, you will design and build your own creature or machine that w
 ill help keep our precious planet clean!\nPlus\, enter a prize draw for a 
 chance to win an awesome book.\nFor kids ages 4 to 8.\nInformation Collect
 ion Notice:\nThe personal information on this form is collected by the Tor
 onto Public Library under the Public Libraries Act\, sections 20(a)\, 20(c
 )\, and 20(d). The information will only be used for event and program reg
 istration\, delivery and evaluation. Questions about how the library handl
 es your information can be directed to Answerline staff at\nanswerline@tpl
 .ca\n\, 416-397-5981\, 789 Yonge Street\, Toronto ON M4W 2G8.
LOCATION:Thorncliffe
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0e3bff43b41b3d0067f905
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Maison des bébés
DTSTART;TZID=America/Toronto:20260710T103000
DTEND;TZID=America/Toronto:20260710T113000
UID:6a0f206ec6a1dc3d00d523e5@tpl.bibliocommons.com
DESCRIPTION:Un programme spécialement conçu pour les bébés de 0 à 18 
 mois et leurs accompagnateurs.\nChanter des chansons et des comptines à v
 otre bébé favorise le développement du langage tout en partageant un mo
 ment amusant et chaleureux.\nLes comptines avec gestes encouragent égalem
 ent les tout‑petits à bouger et à explorer selon leur stade de dévelo
 ppement.\nCe programme est offert en partenariat avec le\nCentre francopho
 ne du Grand Toronto.\nAccessibilité:\nLe sous-titrage en direct ou automa
 tique\, l’interprétation en langue des signes\, les services\nd’inter
 venant\, ou les services d’accompagnement sont disponibles sur demande. 
 Veuillez\nsoumettre votre demande au moins deux semaines à l’avance à 
 : tpl.ca/accessibility-events\nA program specially designed for babies age
 d 0 to 18 months and their caregivers.\nSinging songs and rhymes to your b
 aby helps support language development while sharing a fun and warm moment
  together.\nAction rhymes also encourage little ones to move and explore a
 ccording to their developmental stage.\nThis program is offered in partner
 ship with the\nCentre francophone du Grand Toronto.
LOCATION:New Toronto
URL:https://tpl.bibliocommons.com/v2/events/6a0f206ec6a1dc3d00d523e5
X-SOURCE:Toronto Public Library — Preschool
END:VEVENT
